PokemonMansion_1F_Text_TedIntro::
    .string "Who are you?\n"
    .string "There shouldn't be anyone here.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_TedDefeat::
    .string "Ouch!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_TedPostBattle::
    .string "A key? I don't know what you're\n"
    .string "talking about.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_JohnsonIntro::
    .string "W-w-waah! You startled me!\n"
    .string "I thought you were ONYBRIS.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_JohnsonDefeat::
    .string "Tch!\n"
    .string "I can't get any wins.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_JohnsonPostBattle::
    .string "I came to see the turbines.\n"
    .string "Now there are thugs everywhere.\p"
    .string "I ought to leave while I can.$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_Onybris1Intro::
    .string "The PLANT is ours now, kid!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_Onybris1Defeat::
    .string "Zzzapped…$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_Onybris1Post::
    .string "SELENE is at the transformers.\n"
    .string "Go and get crushed!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_Onybris2Intro::
    .string "No visitors in the turbine hall!$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_Onybris2Defeat::
    .string "Overloaded…$"

PokemonMansion_1F_Text_Onybris2Post::
    .string "The MAYOR opened every door for\n"
    .string "us. Smart man.$"
